<title>Calibration explorer · synthetic</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;background:#f4f8fa;color:#203852;font:16px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif}
main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:24px}h1{font-size:32px;margin:0}
p{max-width:900px}section{background:white;border:1px solid #cddce5;overflow:auto}
